    <p class="text-meta m-0">
      Two directories of markdown · built with Astro · <a
        href="https://github.com/"
        class="text-accent no-underline hover:text-accent-deep transition-colors duration-150 ease-snap">source</a>
    </p>
    <p class="text-meta m-0">© {year} · learned in public</p>
  </div>
</footer>
